  "ANS_SRC_5" [label="(15,0,0) Currently, Genetic ablation of either Caspase-8 or Fadd in intestinal epithelial cells (IECs) results in necroptosis and caspase-8-gasdermin-D-mediated pyroptosis-like death, leading to spontaneous ileitis and/or colitis [18], [19], [20]."];
  "ANS_SRC_6" [label="(11,0,0) Currently, Among Als family proteins, Als3 is the most abundant and hypha-specific protein."];
  "ANS_SRC_7" [label="(25,0,0) Currently, Although there is increasing interest in studying the recognition of fungal extracellular proteins/peptides [24], [25], this intracellular recognition mechanism extends our understanding of innate immune recognition."];
